				<Variable Class="Parameter">
					<Id>1793748836188</Id>
					<Name><![CDATA[parRentInfluenceDecayLength]]></Name>
					<Description><![CDATA[Local density counts up all agents within a cutoff, but each is weighted by the exponential of distance to the node whose density we are calculating. This parameter divides the exponent, controlling rate of influence decay. It is effectively the distance at which the exponential has exponent of -1, so weight will be ~0.37.

written like this so the first part is relative to step lengths of 500 m, and will updated if the scale shifts]]></Description>
					<X>120</X><Y>2290</Y>
					<Label><X>10</X><Y>0</Y></Label>
					<PublicFlag>false</PublicFlag>
